<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>a subsequent liquidation period of approximately two years, during which our leases and secured loans will either mature and terminate or be sold and we will liquidate our other assets.</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
