<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>Total acquisition fees, assuming our anticipated use of financing of 80%, on average, of the cost of the equipment we acquire, would be approximately 7.8% of our offering proceeds. Thus, the total acquisition fees would be approximately $155,818 if we sell the minimum offering amount and $9,349,091 if we sell the maximum offering amount as set forth in the &#147;Use of Proceeds&#148; section of this prospectus. </font></p> </td> </tr></table>
