<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>Not determinable at this time. We will not accrue or pay a subordinated remarketing fee for any portion of sales proceeds which we reinvest. We will subordinate and defer payment of the remarketing fees to the receipt by you and our other limited partners of cash distributions equal to the purchase price of your units plus annual cash distributions equal to 8%, compounded daily, of your capital contributions, as adjusted by certain distributions made to you which are deemed to be a return of capital, on a cumulative basis as described in the &#147;Income, Losses and Distributions &#150; Reinvestment of Our Revenues in Additional Leases and Secured Loans&#148; section of this prospectus.</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
