        <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0in 0in 0in;'>

<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>limit the compensation and fees we will pay our general partner and its affiliates; and</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
</div>




<div align=left>


