<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>Our general partner will also determine the redemption price based on provisions set forth in our partnership agreement. To the extent the formula for arriving at the redemption price has any subjective determinations, they will fall within the discretion of our general partner.</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
