        <td width="5%" valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0in 0in 0in;'>

<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=3><b>&#149;</b></font></p> </td>

        <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0in 0in 0in;'>

<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>during the reinvestment period, enter into or purchase equipment leases and secured loans using our net offering proceeds from this offering, and borrow funds to increase diversification of our portfolio, and reinvesting our revenues after paying our expenses, establishing appropriate reserves and making certain distributions to you and our other investors; and</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
</div>




<div align=left>


