            <p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>Re-leasing to lessee &#150; We anticipate that a significant amount of our equipment will be re-leased to the current lessee at the end of the initial lease term.</font></p> </td> </tr></table>






