        as well as the lessees having the largest positions in the portfolio.
        If we then decide to pursue the portfolio acquisition, LEAF Financial
        will do a credit analysis of the entire portfolio, or a larger sampling,
        through credit scoring, financial analysis or other appropriate procedures.
        The results of LEAF Financial&#146;s analysis will be presented to our
        general partner&#146;s investment committee, which also serves as LEAF
        Financial&#146;s investment committee as discussed in the &#147;Management
        &#150; Investment Committee&#148; section of this prospectus, which will
        decide which portfolios, if any, we will make an offer to acquire and
        the terms of our offer.</font></p>
