            <p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:6pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'>&nbsp;</p> </td>
        <td width="3%" valign=top style='padding:4.0pt 0in 0in 0in;'>
            <p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><b><font size=3><b>&#149;</b></font></b></p> </td>
        <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0in 0in 0in;'>
            <p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><b><font size=2>Each potential limited partner is urged to seek advice based on his particular circumstances from an independent tax advisor with respect to the federal tax consequences to him of an investment in us.</font></b></p> </td> </tr></table>





