            <p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>The passive activity limitations on losses and credits under &sect;469 of the Code will apply to our typical limited partners. </font></p> </td> </tr></table>






<table border="0" cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="100%" style=' border-collapse:collapse;'> <tr>
