            <p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>your personal tax situation, such as the amount of your regular taxable income, alternative minimum taxable income, losses, itemized deductions, personal exemptions, etc., which are not related to your investment in us;</font></p> </td> </tr></table>






