        <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0in 0in 0in;'>
            <p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>As a limited partner, your initial tax basis in your units will be the purchase price of your units.</font></p> </td> </tr></table>






<table border="0" cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="100%" style=' border-collapse:collapse;'> <tr>
