            <p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><b><font size=2>Private Transfers.</font></b><font size=2> Private transfers are not counted. Private transfers include, but are not limited to the following:</font></p> </td> </tr></table>






