<p style=' margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:12pt;text-align:left;'><b><font size=2><a name="p58a"></a>Passive Activity Limitations on Losses</font></b></p>

<p style=' margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:8pt;text-align:left;'><font size=2>The passive activity rules under &sect;469 of the Code allow taxpayers to deduct their passive activity losses only against their passive activity income. Under these rules, taxpayers generally must separate their income and loss into three categories:</font></p>



<div align=left>


