<p style=' margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:8pt;text-align:left;'><font size=2>One of the four types of reportable transactions noted above that are in addition to listed transactions, is a &#147;loss transaction,&#148; if a significant purpose of the transaction is federal income tax avoidance or evasion. Under Treas. Reg. &sect;1.6011-4, a loss transaction, subject to certain exceptions, is any investment resulting in a partnership or any noncorporate partner of a partnership claiming:</font></p>



