    </td>
    <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;'>
      <p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>the
        selection of a substitute general partner, and the acceptance of its appointment
        as our substitute general partner by limited partners owning a majority
        of our units.</font></p>
    </td>
