<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>to any person if, in our counsel&#146;s opinion, the assignment would terminate our taxable year or adversely affect our status as a limited partnership for federal income tax purposes;</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
</div>






