<p style=' margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:8pt;text-align:left;'><font size=2>Your units are illiquid and can be redeemed by us only if the redemption provisions in our partnership agreement, which are summarized below, are met. If we do redeem your units, which is in our general partner&#146;s sole discretion, the redemption price for your units will depend on when you present your units for redemption. If you present your units for redemption:</font></p>



