<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>during the offering period, the redemption price for one unit will equal the net asset value at that time of one unit as determined by our general partner;</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
