<p style=' margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:8pt;text-align:left;'><font size=2>Selling dealers must forward subscription checks to the dealer-manager promptly, but in no event later than noon of the next business day following their receipt. The dealer-manager must forward these subscription checks to the bank escrow agent promptly, but in no event later than noon of the next business day following their receipt by the dealer-manager. Our general partner will promptly review each subscription and either will accept or decline your subscription as a limited partner.</font></p>

