<p style=' margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:8pt;text-align:left;'><font size=2><b>Income Taxes</b></font></p>
<p style=' margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:8pt;text-align:left;'><font size=2>Federal
    and state income tax laws provide that the income or losses of the Fund are
    reportable by the Partners on their individual income tax returns. Accordingly,
    no provision for such taxes has been made in the accompanying financial statements.</font></p>
<br>
