        <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0in 0in 0in;'>

<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>&#147;</font><b><font size=2>Dealer-Manager</font></b><font size=2>&#148; means Chadwick Securities, Inc., an Affiliate of the General Partner, the broker/dealer which will manage the offer and sale of the Units in all states in the Offering.</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
</div>




<div align=left>


