        <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0in 0in 0in;'>

<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>an amount equal to 0.08335% (1% annually) of Gross Revenues on Operating Leases managed by third-parties under the General Partner&#146;s supervision;</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
</div>




<div align=left>


<table border="0" cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="100%" style=' border-collapse:collapse;'>
    <tr>

        <td width="5%" valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0in 0in 0in;'>

