<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>(xxv)</font></p> </td>

        <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;'>

<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>during the Reinvestment Period, but subject to the limitations and requirements of Section 11.1(b), to reinvest all or a substantial portion of the Partnership&#146;s Distributable Cash in additional Investments;</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
</div>






