<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>the compensation, price or fee charged for providing such services must be comparable and competitive with the compensation, price or fee of any other Person who is rendering comparable services or selling or leasing comparable goods and materials which could reasonably be made available to the Partnership;</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
