        <td width="5%" valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;'>

<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=1>&nbsp;</font></p> </td>

        <td width="5%" valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;'>

<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>(iii)</font></p> </td>

        <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;'>

<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>there is no difference in the interest terms of any Indebtedness secured by the Investment at the time it is acquired by the General Partner or such Affiliate and the time it is acquired by the Partnership;</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
</div>






