        <td width="5%" valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;'>

<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>(v)</font></p> </td>

        <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;'>

<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>at the time of transfer thereof to the Partnership, the General Partner or such Affiliate had held such Investment on a temporary or interim basis (generally not longer than 6 months) for the purposes of:</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
</div>






<div align=left>


