<p style=' margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:8pt;text-align:left;'><b><font size=2>9.2(c). Loans to or from the General Partner and its Affiliates</font></b><font size=2>. No loans may be made by the Partnership to the General Partner or any Affiliate of the General Partner. The General Partner or any Affiliate of the General Partner may loan or advance funds to the Partnership provided that:</font></p>



<div align=left>


<table border="0" cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="100%" style=' border-collapse:collapse;'>
