<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>(i)</font></p> </td>

        <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;'>

<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>any interest or other financing charges or fees payable by the Partnership in connection with the loan shall not exceed the lesser of the following:</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
</div>






<div align=left>


<table border="0" cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="100%" style=' border-collapse:collapse;'>
    <tr>

        <td width="10%" valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;'>

<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2.0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=1>&nbsp;</font></p> </td>

        <td width="5%" valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;'>

<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>(A)</font></p> </td>

        <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;'>

<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>the rate of interest and other amounts paid or payable by the General Partner or the Affiliate in connection with the loan (if the General Partner or the Affiliate borrowed money for the specific purpose of making the loan); or</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
</div>






<div align=left>


<table border="0" cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="100%" style=' border-collapse:collapse;'>
    <tr>

        <td width="10%" valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;'>

