<p style=' margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:8pt;text-align:left;'><b><font size=2>9.3(c). Securities Act Liability</font></b><font size=2>. Notwithstanding the above, the General Partner and its Affiliates, including the Dealer-Manager, and any Person acting as a broker-dealer, including the Selling Dealers, shall not be indemnified by the Partnership for any losses, liabilities or expenses arising from or out of an alleged violation of federal or state securities laws unless:</font></p>



