<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>Except as otherwise provided in this Section 9.4(j), Partnership expenses other than those reimbursed in accordance with subsections (b) through (i) of this Section 9.4 shall be billed directly to and paid by the Partnership.</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
</div>






