<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>(ii)</font></p> </td>

        <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;'>

<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>Subject to clause (iv), the General Partner and its Affiliates may be reimbursed for the actual cost of goods, materials and services used for or by the Partnership and obtained by it or them from non-Affiliates of the General Partner.</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
