<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>Subject to clause (iv), the General Partner and its Affiliates may be reimbursed for the administrative services reasonably necessary, convenient or advisable, in the sole discretion of the General Partner, to the prudent operation of the Partnership (including, without limitation, legal, accounting, remarketing and agency expenses) provided that such reimbursement shall not exceed the lesser of:</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
