<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>(B)</font></p> </td>

        <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;'>

<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>the amount the Partnership would be required to pay to non-Affiliates for comparable administrative services in the same geographic location; and</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
</div>




<p style=' margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:8pt; margin-left:10%;text-align:left;'><font size=2>provided, further, that there shall be no reimbursement for such services if the General Partner or its Affiliates are entitled to compensation in the form of a separate fee pursuant to other provisions of this Section 9.4.</font></p>



