<p style='margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>The General Partner and its Affiliates shall not be reimbursed by the Partnership for amounts expended by them with respect to the following:</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
