        <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0in 0in 0in;'>

<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>during the Offering Period, the Redemption price for one Unit will equal the net asset value for one Unit at the time the Redemption request is received, as that value is determined by the General Partner in its sole discretion;</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
</div>




