<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>(ii)</font></p> </td>

        <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0in 0in 0in;'>

<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>during the Reinvestment Period, but after the Offering Period of the Offering, the Redemption price for one Unit will equal 100% of the Limited Partner&#146;s Adjusted Capital Contribution for one Unit, plus 4% for each full twelve-month period since the Limited Partner was admitted as a Limited Partner, less the sum of:</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
</div>




<div align=left>


<table border="0" cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width="100%" style=' border-collapse:collapse;'>
