<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>100% of previous distributions made to the Limited Partner on account of one Unit; and</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
</div>




