        <td width="5%" valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0in 0in 0in;'>

<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>(B)</font></p> </td>

        <td valign=top style='padding:6.0pt 0in 0in 0in;'>

<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>100% of any previous allocations to the Limited Partner of investment tax credit amounts, if any, for one Unit; or</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
</div>


