<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>stating the date of the Redemption of the Units, which shall be a date within 30 days following the date of the Notice;</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
