<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>advising the Limited Partner that not less than 10 days before the Redemption date stated in the Notice (the &#147;Delivery Date&#148;) that the Limited Partner must duly execute and deliver to the Partnership all transfer instruments and other documents requested by the Partnership to evidence the Redemption of the Units. In the General Partner&#146;s discretion, these transfer instruments and documents may be prepared by the Partnership and enclosed with the Notice.</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
