<p style=' margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:8pt;text-align:left;'><font size=2>On or before the Redemption date stated in the Notice, the Partnership shall pay the Applicable Redemption Price to the Limited Partner for each Unit Redeemed if:</font></p>


