</div>



<p style=' margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:8pt;text-align:left;'><b><font size=2>15.5(c). Reports to State Securities Law Administrators</font></b><font size=2>. The General Partner shall submit to all state securities law Administrators, including Arizona, California and Ohio, any information which such Administrator requires, including, but not limited to:</font></p>


