<p style=' margin-left:0pt;text-indent:0pt;text-align:left;margin-top:2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;'><font size=2>prepare, or cause the Accountants to prepare, in accordance with applicable laws and regulations, the Partnership&#146;s tax returns (federal, state, local and foreign, if any) for each Fiscal Year within 75 days after the end of such Fiscal Year; and</font></p> </td> </tr></table>
