<p style=' margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt;text-align:left;'><b><font size=2>16.1(b). Delivery of Notice.</font></b><font size=2> A Notice of any such meeting or action by written Consent shall be given to all Limited Partners either:</font></p>


